24
00:01:58.314 --> 00:02:02.334
the shallow pit. Kaycee watched as Bruce and Uncle lowered a whole pig

25
00:02:02.335 --> 00:02:05.631
into the pit. Then she helped them cover it with

26
00:02:05.632 --> 00:02:09.079
